{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>He shall not defile himself, being a chief man among his people, to profane himself.</b> The Rav [explains] בכור שור [meaning] like 'a master among his people' — meaning that even for a Kohen Gadol who dies, who is a master and lord and whose sanctity is great, another kohen may not defile himself for him if he is not among the relatives mentioned in the verse."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:20.518507093Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}